# Round 18, C1-35 with C1-18 (follows). L §4.6 step 5: none outside a lifespan holds for a thing "other than a movement
# (whose facts hold on every read day, §5.7)": tag has no row for pay[2026-03], so its read is HOLE-UNGOVERNED on its
# day and after it, never none.
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind contribs: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place acct: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..
input amt: money PLN
input tag[c in contribs]: int
move pay[m in months]: contribs
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to acct amount amt
def tag_at[c in contribs, d in days]: int = tag[c] at d
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  amt = 1
ask q: tag_at[pay[2026-03], 2026-06-01], tag_at[pay[2026-03], 2026-03-01]
=== expect
q: (?"tag at pay[2026-03]: no value at 2026-06-01" (tag[pay[2026-03]]), ?"tag at pay[2026-03]: no value at 2026-03-01" (tag[pay[2026-03]]))
  cut 2026-12-31
